# Certificates are NOT committed here.
#
# Not because they are secret -- an X.509 certificate is public by design --
# but because the FlashBlade's certificate carries the NFS data VIP in its
# subject, and this repo redacts internal addresses (top-level README
# § Conventions). A certificate cannot be redacted without breaking it, so it
# is kept out of version control instead.
#
# Obtain it per files/README.md before deploying.
*.crt
*.pem
*.key
